          "gs2": "Heritage Policy: ASI public-private partnerships under 'Adopt a Heritage' (Apni Dharohar, Apni Pehchaan).",
          "gs3": "Inclusive Economy: Handicrafts clusters and local village economies around UNESCO sites.",
